{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Coffee is a drink made by placing 5 ",["l","咖啡豆","Coffee Bean"],"s inside a ",["l","小桶","Keg"],", or purchased at ",["l","星之果实酒吧","the Stardrop Saloon"]," for 300g. At the ",["l","夜市","Night Market"],", one free cup of coffee per night can be obtained from the ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"],". Coffee is sold at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," in ",["l","乔治","George"],"'s and ",["l","哈维","Harvey"],"'s ",["l","沙漠节","shops"],". One Coffee is a reward for submitting an ",["l","沙漠节","Egg Rating"]," of 5-9 to ",["l","吉尔","Gil"]," during the Desert Festival. If the player owns a ",["l","咖啡机","Coffee Maker"],", they can acquire one free cup of coffee every morning. 1-2 Coffee may occasionally be found in ",["l","补给箱","Supply Crate"],"s on the ",["l","农场地图","Beach Farm"]," if the player has not upgraded the ",["l","农舍","Farmhouse"]," yet. 3 Coffee is a guaranteed gold tier reward on the 12th for the ",["l","鱿鱼节","SquidFest"]," festival. Wearing a ",["l","热咖啡戒指","Hot Java Ring"]," gives a 25% chance for monsters to drop Coffee when killed. Three Coffee may be received from opening a ",["l","谜之盒","Mystery Box"],"."]],["p",["When consumed, it grants the player +1 ",["l","速度","Speed"]," for 1m 23s. The speed of the player’s ",["l","动物","horse"]," is also increased. As a drink, its ",["l","效果","buff"]," stacks with any food buffs (including Speed), but replaces any other drink buffs (i.e., from ",["l","三倍浓缩咖啡","Triple Shot Espresso"],", ",["l","姜汁汽水","Ginger Ale"]," or ",["l","绿茶","Green Tea"],")."]],["p",["Unlike all other Keg products, Coffee is not considered to be an ",["l","工匠物品","Artisan Good"],". Therefore, its sale price does not benefit from the ",["l","技能","Artisan"]," profession. Also, Coffee cannot be sold to the ",["l","皮埃尔的杂货店","General Store"],"; it must be sold using the ",["l","售卖","Shipping Bin"],"."]],["p",["Note that 5 beans of the same quality (normal, silver, or gold) must be used to make coffee; the keg will not accept beans that are not in one stack of 5."]]]],["Gifting",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Love"]},[["l","哈维","Harvey"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Like"]},[["l","罗宾","Robin"],", ",["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],", ",["l","玛鲁","Maru"],", ",["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"],", ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],", ",["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"],", ",["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],", ",["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],", ",["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],", ",["l","乔治","George"],", ",["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],", ",["l","刘易斯","Lewis"],", ",["l","克林特","Clint"],", ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],", ",["l","潘姆","Pam"],", ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],", ",["l","海莉","Haley"],", ",["l","乔迪","Jodi"],", ",["l","肯特","Kent"],", ",["l","山姆","Sam"],", ",["l","莉亚","Leah"],", ",["l","谢恩","Shane"],", ",["l","玛妮","Marnie"],", ",["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"],", ",["l","格斯","Gus"],", ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],", ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", ",["l","威利","Willy"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Neutral"]},[["l","雷欧","Leo"]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Hate"]},[["l","贾斯","Jas"],", ",["l","文森特","Vincent"]]]]]]],["Bundles",2,[["p",["Coffee is not used in any ",["l","收集包","bundles"],"."]]]],["Recipes",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Energy / Health"]},{"h":1,"v":["Buff(s)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Buff Duration"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source(s)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sell Price"]}],[[["l","三倍浓缩咖啡","Triple Shot Espresso"]],["It's more potent than regular coffee!"],[["i","(O)395","Coffee ×3"]],["Energy 8\nHealth 3"],[["l","速度","Speed (+1)"]],["4m 12s"],[["l","星之果实酒吧","Stardrop Saloon"]," for 5,000g"],["450g"]]]]]],["Tailoring",2,[["p",["Coffee can be used in the spool of the ",["l","柳巷2号","Sewing Machine"]," to create the ",["l","裁缝","Pour-Over Shirt"],". It can be used in ",["l","染色","dyeing"],", serving as an orange dye at the dye pots, located in ",["l","艾米丽","Emily"],"'s and ",["l","海莉","Haley"],"'s house, ",["l","柳巷2号","2 Willow Lane"],"."]]]],["Quests",2,[["p",["Coffee is not used in any ",["l","任务","quests"],"."]]]]],"f":[["Source",[["l","小桶","Keg"]," 